{"strongs": "H6951", "word": "קָהָל", "translit": "qa.hal", "root": "קהל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "assembly, convocation, congregation", "definition": "קָהָל 123 noun masculine Ezek 38:15 assembly, convocation, congregation ; — absolute ׳ ק Jer 31:8 +; construct קְהַל Exod 12:6 +; suffix קְהָלָ֑ךָ Ezek 38:13 , etc.; plural suffix קְהָלֶיךָ Ezek 38:7 — 1. assembly specially convoked: \\ \\ a. for evil counsel, || סוד Gen 49:6 (poem); מרעים ׳ ק Ps 26:5 for civil affairs Prov 5:14 (see Toy), Prov 26:26 ; Job 30:28 ( Di publice ). \\ \\ b. for war or invasion, Num 22:4 ( E ), Judg 20:2 ; Judg 21:5 ; Judg 21:8 ; 1Sam 17:47 ; Ezek 16:40 ; Ezek 38:7 (plural only here), + 8 t. Ezekiel; גדול ׳ ק (|| חיל רב ) Ezek 38:15 רב ׳ ק (|| חיל גדול ) Ezek 17:17 ; Ezek 38:4 גוים ׳ ק Jer 50:9 עמים ׳ ק Ezek 23:24 ; Ezek 32:3 . \\ \\ c. company of returning exiles, Jer 31:8 ; Ezra 2:64 = Neh 7:66 . \\ \\ d. for religious purposes, to hear words of ׳ י at Horeb Deut 5:19 , ׳ ביום הק Deut 9:10 ; Deut 10:4 (gloss, not in ᵐ5 ), Deut 18:16 word of Jeremiah Jer 26:17 ; Jer 44:15 for feasts, fasts and worship 2Chr 20:5 ; 2Chr 30:25 (twice in verse); Neh 5:13 ; Joel 2:16 ; Ps 107:32 רב ׳ ק Ps 22:26 + 4 t.; לרב מְאֹד ׳ וַיֵּאָֽסְפו ק֗֗֗ 2Chr 30:13 גדול ׳ ק 1Kgs 8:65 = 2Chr 7:8 ׳ בתוך (ה)ק 2Chr 20:14 ; Ps 22:23 . 2. congregation , as organized body: \\ \\ a. of Israel: יהוה ׳ ק Mic 2:5 ; Num 16:3 ; Num 20:4 ( P ), 1Chr 28:8 ( ׳ י ) ׳ באבק Deut 23:2 ; Deut 23:3 (twice in verse); Deut 23:4 (twice in verse); Deut 23:9 ; Neh 13:1 ; Lam 1:10 ישׂראל ׳ כל ק Deut 31:30 ; Josh 8:35 ( D ) Lev 16:17 ( P ) 1Kgs 8:14 (twice in verse); 1Kgs 8:22 ; 1Kgs 8:55 = 2Chr 6:3 (twice in verse); 2Chr 6:12 ; 2Chr 6:13 , 1Kgs 12:3 ; 1Chr 13:2 עדת ישׂראל ׳ כל ק Exod 12:6 ( ᵐ5 reads בני before ׳ יִשׂ ), Num 14:5 ( P ; ᵐ5 συναγωγή ; ᵑ0 probably conflation); ׳ כל עם הק Lev 16:33 ׳ כל הק Exod 16:3 ( P ) 1Chr 13:4 + 12 t. Chronicles; ׳ הק Lev 4:13 ; Lev 4:14 ; Lev 4:21 + 8 t. Numbers ( P ) 8 t. 2 Chronicles \\ \\ b. restored community in Jerusalem Ezra 10:12 ; Ezra 10:14 ; Neh 8:2 ; Neh 8:17 הֵגּוֺלָה ׳ ק Ezra 10:8 later the better part of it, חסידים ׳ ק Ps 149:1 . \\ \\ c. of angels, קדשׁים ׳ ק Ps 89:6 . \\ \\ d. more general: company , assembled multitude, גוים ׳ ק Gen 35:11 ( P ), עמים ׳ ק Gen 28:3 ; Gen 48:4 ( P ), רפאים ׳ ק Prov 21:16 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7332')\">BDB7332</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6951')\">H6951</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7331')\">BDB7331</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7333')\">BDB7333</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָהָל</bdbheb><sub>123</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ezek 38:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,15)\">Ezek 38:15</ref></sup> <highlightword>assembly, convocation, congregation</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 31:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,8)\">Jer 31:8</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>קְהַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 12:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,6)\">Exod 12:6</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>קְהָלָ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,13)\">Ezek 38:13</ref>, etc.; plural suffix <bdbheb>קְהָלֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,7)\">Ezek 38:7</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>assembly</highlight> specially convoked: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> for evil counsel, || <bdbheb>סוד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,6)\">Gen 49:6</ref> (poem); <bdbheb>מרעים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 26:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv